# Cloudflare Pages response headers (production). Same isolation headers as vite.config.ts sends in
# dev/preview: COOP + COEP make the page cross-origin isolated, which onnxruntime-web needs for
# SharedArrayBuffer (multi-threaded WASM). Cross-origin fetches still work when the other side
# answers with CORS: the Hugging Face model, ml.tryheard.tech, api.tryheard.tech.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin

# Hashed build output never changes under the same name.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
